{"id":"palma","lemma":"palma","pos":"noun","rank":2932,"glosses":["palm (inner part of the hand)","clap (the act of striking the palms of the hands)","applause"],"ipa":"/ˈpal.mɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"palmas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-palma.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom bateu palmas.","en":"Tom clapped his hands.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/533734","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to beat","l":"bater"},null]},{"text":"Conheço essas ruas como a palma da mão.","en":"I know these streets like the back of my hand.","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conhecer"},{"g":"that, that one","l":"esse"},{"g":"street","l":"rua"},{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"hand"}]},{"text":"Tom conhece a cidade como a palma de sua mão.","en":"Tom knows the city like the back of his hand.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to know","l":"conhecer"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"city, town"},{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his","l":"seu"},{"g":"hand"}]},{"text":"Nós batemos palmas.","en":"We clapped our hands.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to beat","l":"bater"},null]},{"text":"As luzes se acendem quando se bate palmas.","en":"The lights turn on when you clap.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"light","l":"luz"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"to light","l":"acender"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"to beat","l":"bater"},null]}]}